    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadowland: Rise of the Fallen</strong> takes place in a post-apocalyptic world where darkness has stolen the planet's light and hope is on the brink of extinction. Nightking and his generals have seized the legendary artifact \u201cAnima Core,\u201d turning the sun into a black hole. As one of the last survivors, you must lead a desperate resistance and reclaim the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose between 3 playable characters, command 7 ally unit types, and face off against 9 different enemy types in tactical battles across the doomed lands of Shadowland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a story-driven single-player mode, dynamic combat mechanics, a visually striking light-based UI system, and a world brimming with danger, <strong>Shadowland</strong> offers a unique action-strategy experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Story-rich single-player campaign<br>\u2022 Tactical real-time combat with ally command system<br>\u2022 Light-based UI indicators for enemy/ally distinction<br>\u2022 A dark, immersive post-apocalyptic fantasy world<br>\u2022 Reactive enemy system where each fallen enemy brings new threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you stop the Nightking and restore balance, or will darkness reign forever?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadowland: Rise of the Fallen</strong> takes place in a post-apocalyptic world where darkness has stolen the planet's light and hope is on the brink of extinction. Nightking and his generals have seized the legendary artifact \u201cAnima Core,\u201d turning the sun into a black hole. As one of the last survivors, you must lead a desperate resistance and reclaim the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose between 3 playable characters, command 7 ally unit types, and face off against 9 different enemy types in tactical battles across the doomed lands of Shadowland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a story-driven single-player mode, dynamic combat mechanics, a visually striking light-based UI system, and a world brimming with danger, <strong>Shadowland</strong> offers a unique action-strategy experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Story-rich single-player campaign<br>\u2022 Tactical real-time combat with ally command system<br>\u2022 Light-based UI indicators for enemy/ally distinction<br>\u2022 A dark, immersive post-apocalyptic fantasy world<br>\u2022 Reactive enemy system where each fallen enemy brings new threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you stop the Nightking and restore balance, or will darkness reign forever?</p>",
    "short_description": "In a world where the light has died, you are the last spark of hope. Shadowland: Rise of the Fallen is a single-player, cinematic action-strategy experience with tactical combat and a haunting post-apocalyptic setting.",
